OL,3,AMbappe dropped by major Chinese brands
OL,4,Adrop as backlash grows over Mao joke
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral Chinese brands have dropped
OL,7,FFrench footballer Kylian Mbappe
OL,8,Ffollowing a a backlash over alleged
OL,9,Fcomments referring to the late Chinese
OL,10,Fleader Mao Zedong.
OL,12,FMbappe reportedly told a French talk
OL,13,Fshow The Bridge the meme "that makes me
OL,14,Flaugh the most, it's the one where
OL,15,Fthere's a video of a guy, I think it's
OL,16,Fa Chinese dictator..."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
