OL,3,AMbappe dropped by major Chinese brands
OL,4,Adrop as backlash grows over Mao joke
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs he trails off, a meme of his face
OL,7,Fsuperimposed on an image resembling Mao
OL,8,Fappears. The Real Madrid forward's
OL,9,Fnickname - "the dictator" - because of
OL,10,Fhis huge influence is a popular meme
OL,11,Fand a running joke.
OL,13,FBut the joke did not go down well in
OL,14,FChina, where Mao is revered by the
OL,15,FCommunist Party, despite his chaotic
OL,16,Fand often violent rule that left
OL,17,Fmillions dead.
